{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00678","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 咸宁舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 咸宁舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於铄丕嗣，惟帝之光。\n羽龠象德，金石荐祥。\n圣系无极，景命永昌。\n神降上哲，维天配长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}